t("Hurricane", "飓风", "_t")
t("+Hurricane", "+飓风", "_t")
t("-Hurricane", "-飓风", "_t")
t("There are creatures that could be watching you; you cannot take the risk of teleporting to Angolwen.", "可能有生物正在监视你，你不能冒险传送到安格利文。", "log")
t("There are creatures that could be watching you; you cannot take the risk of timeporting to Point Zero.", "可能有生物正在注视你；你不能冒险传送至零点圣域。", "log")
t("You are yanked out of this time!", "你突然被拽离了当前时间！", "logPlayer")
t("Reduces %s damage received by %d%%.", "降低受到的 %s 伤害 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#Target# casts a protective shield just in time!", "#Target#及时召唤出了一个保护护盾！", "_t")
t("The target is infected with a corrosive worm, reducing blight and acid resistance by %d%%. When the effect ends, the worm will explode, dealing %d acid damage in a 4 radius ball. This damage will increase by %d%% of all damage taken while under torment", "目标被腐蚀蠕虫感染，减少 %d%% 酸性和枯萎抗性，效果结束后，蠕虫团将爆炸，在半径 4 范围内造成 %d 酸性伤害。效果期间所受伤害的 %d%% 会加到爆炸伤害上。", "tformat")
t("Turn into a wraith, passing through walls (but not natural obstacles), granting %d defense and %d armour.", "进入鬼魂形态，可以穿墙（但不能穿过天然障碍），并获得 %d 闪避和 %d 护甲值。", "tformat")
t("The target's light and darkness spell penetration has been increased by %d%%.", "目标的光系和暗影法术穿透提高 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("A divine glyph recently triggered, providing %d%% light and darkness affinity and resistence.", "圣印最近被触发过，提供 %d%% 光系和暗影伤害亲和与抗性。", "tformat")
t("Inflicted with a fatiguing starlight, taking %d darkness damage and increasing the cooldown of a cooling-down talent by 1 whenever they act", "受到疲倦星光影响，目标每次行动时会受到 %d 点暗影伤害，并使一个正在冷却的技能的冷却时间延长 1 回合", "tformat")
t("Light damage has been increased by %d%% to +%d%%.", "光系伤害加成增加了 %d%%，变成 +%d%%。", "tformat")
t("Projectiles aimed at the target are slowed by %d%%.", "射向目标的投射物速度降低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("The target has been returned to a much younger state, reducing all its stats by %d.", "目标的年龄大幅倒退，所有属性降低 %d 点。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is returned to a much younger state!", "#Target#的年龄大幅倒退！", "_t")
t("The target is wasting away, taking %0.2f temporal damage per turn.", "目标正在逐渐衰竭，每回合受到 %0.2f 点时空伤害。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is wasting away!", "#Target#正在逐渐衰竭！", "_t")
t("#Target# stops wasting away.", "#Target#不再衰竭。", "_t")
t("The target's awareness is fully in the present, increasing stealth detection, see invisibility, defense, and accuracy by %d.", "目标的意识完全立足于当下，潜行侦测、隐形侦测、闪避和命中提高 %d 点。", "tformat")
t("Gather the Threads", "聚拢时间线", "_t")
t("The target's spellpower has been increased by %d and will continue to increase by %d each turn.", "目标法术强度已提高 %d，每回合进一步提高 %d。", "tformat")
t("+Gather the Threads", "+聚拢时间线", "_t")
t("-Gather the Threads", "-聚拢时间线", "_t")
t("The target's resistances have been reduced by %d%%.", "目标的所有抗性降低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Increases the target combat power, spellpower, accuracy by %d, armour penetration by %d and critical chances by %d.", "目标的攻击强度、法术强度和命中提高 %d 点，护甲穿透提高 %d 点，暴击率提高 %d 点。", "tformat")
t("#Target# seems less powerful.", "#Target#似乎变弱了。", "_t")
t("Any attacks doing more than %d%% of your life is reduced to %d%%.", "所有超过你生命值 %d%% 的伤害都会被降低至 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Temporal Destabilization", "时空失稳", "_t")
t("Target is destabilized and in %d turns will start suffering %0.2f temporal damage per turn.  If it dies with this effect active after the damage starts it will explode.", "目标陷入时空失稳状态，%d 回合后将开始每回合受到 %0.2f 点时空伤害。伤害开始后，若目标在该效果持续期间死亡，就会爆炸。", "tformat")
t("+Temporal Destabilization", "+时空失稳", "_t")
t("-Temporal Destabilization", "-时空失稳", "_t")
t("Target is destabilized and suffering %0.2f temporal damage per turn.  If it dies with this effect active it will explode.", "目标陷入时空失稳状态，每回合受到 %0.2f 时空伤害。如果目标在效果持续时死亡则会爆炸。", "tformat")
t("The target is moving is %d%% faster.", "目标移动速度增加 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Increases attack, spell, and mind speed by %d%%.", "增加攻击、施法和精神速度 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("The target is being removed from the timeline, its resistance to physical and temporal damage have been reduced by %d%%.", "目标正被移出时间线，其物理与时空抗性降低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#CRIMSON#A piece of the soul of %s is torn apart by Impending Doom!", "#CRIMSON#%s的灵魂被灾厄降临撕裂了一片！", "logSeen")
t("The target is slowed by %d%%.", "目标被减速 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Abyssal Shroud", "深渊裹幕", "_t")
t("The target's lite radius has been reduced by %d, and its darkness resistance by %d%%.", "目标光照范围减少 %d，暗影抗性下降 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is free from the abyss.", "#Target#逃离了深渊。", "_t")
t("The target's defense and saves have been increased by %d.", "目标的闪避与豁免增加 %d。", "tformat")
t("#Target# spins fate.", "#Target#编织命运。", "_t")
t("Overwhelming magic has temporarily interfered with all damage resistances, lowering them by %d%%.", "强大的法力暂时干扰了目标的伤害抗性，使其全体抗性降低%d%%。", "tformat")
t("The target is infected by a disease, reducing its constitution by %d and doing %0.2f blight damage per turn.", "目标感染了疾病，体质降低 %d，并每回合受到 %0.2f 枯萎伤害。", "tformat")
t("The target is infected by a disease, reducing its dexterity by %d and doing %0.2f blight damage per turn.", "目标感染了疾病，敏捷降低 %d，并每回合受到 %0.2f 枯萎伤害。", "tformat")
t("The target is infected by a disease, reducing its strength by %d and doing %0.2f blight damage per turn.", "目标感染了疾病，力量降低 %d，并每回合受到 %0.2f 枯萎伤害。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is free from the woeful disease.", "#Target#摆脱了恐怖疾病。", "_t")
t("The target is weakened and lost, all damage it does is reduced by %d%%.", "目标迷失而虚弱，造成的所有伤害减少 %d%%。", "tformat")
t([[The target is infected by a disease, doing %0.2f blight damage per turn and reducing healing received by %d%%.
Each non-disease blight damage done to it will spread the disease.]], [[目标感染了疫病，每回合受到 %0.2f 枯萎伤害，所受治疗效果降低 %d%%。
每次对其造成非疾病来源的枯萎伤害时，都会传播该疫病。]], "tformat")
t([[The target is infected with carrion worm larvae.  Each turn it will lose one beneficial physical effect and %0.2f blight and acid damage will be inflicted.
After five turns the disease will inflict %0.2f blight damage and spawn a carrion worm mass.]], [[目标被腐肉幼虫感染，每回合会丢失一个物理增益效果并受到 %0.2f 枯萎和酸性伤害。
5 回合后，该疾病会造成 %0.2f 枯萎伤害并生成一个腐肉虫群。]], "tformat")
t("#LIGHT_RED#A carrion worm mass bursts out of %s!", "#LIGHT_RED#腐肉虫群从%s体内爆出！", "logSeen")
t("  If the target dies while ghoul rot is active it will rise as a ghoul.", "  如果目标在尸鬼腐蚀期间死亡，它将作为食尸鬼复活。", "_t")
t("The target is infected by a disease doing %0.2f blight damage per turn.%s", "目标感染疾病，每回合造成 %0.2f 点枯萎伤害。%s", "tformat")
t("#Target# is afflicted by ghoul rot!", "#Target#受到了尸鬼腐蚀！", "_t")
t("#Target# is free from the ghoul rot.", "#Target#摆脱了尸鬼腐蚀。", "_t")
t("Corruptions consume health instead of vim.", "堕落系法术消耗生命值而非活力值。", "_t")
t("Maximum life increased by %d.", "最大生命值提升 %d。", "tformat")
t("The arcane energy around #target# has dissipated.", "#target#周围的奥术能量消失。", "_t")
t("#Target# warded against %s!", "#Target#获得了对%s的防护！", "tformat")
t("The target's spellpower has been increased by %d.", "目标的法术强度提升 %d。", "tformat")
t([[The target is out of phase with reality, increasing defense by %d, resist all by %d%%, and reducing the duration of detrimental timed effects by %d%%.
These effects cap at 40%%.]], [[目标脱离了现实相位，增加 %d 闪避，%d%% 全体伤害抗性并减少 %d%% 所有负面状态的持续时间。
最高效果为 40%%。]], "tformat")
t("Reduces global action speed by %d%% and all outgoing projectiles speed by %d%%.", "减少 %d%% 全局速度和 %d%% 自身发射的所有抛射物速度。", "tformat")
t("An arcane vortex follows the target. Each turn a manathrust fires from it to a random foe in sight doing %0.2f arcane damage to all. If no foes are found the main target takes 50%% more arcane damage this turn. If the target dies the remaining damage is dealt as a radius 2 ball of arcane.", "一个奥术漩涡跟随着目标。每回合，一发奥术射线从漩涡处射向视野内随机一名敌人，对漩涡附着的目标和射线路径上的所有目标造成 %0.2f 奥术伤害。如果没有找到敌人，本回合漩涡对其附着的目标造成的奥术伤害提高 50%%。如果目标死亡，剩余伤害将转化为半径 2 的奥术爆炸。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is focused by an arcane vortex!", "#Target#被奥术漩涡围绕！", "_t")
t("Fires an arcane explosion each turn doing %0.2f arcane damage in radius 2.", "每回合触发一个奥术爆炸，在 2 码范围内造成 %0.2f 奥术伤害。", "tformat")
t("#Target# begins channeling arcane through a breach in reality!", "#Target#从现实的裂口中传导奥术能量！", "_t")
t("The target is afflicted with a magical poison and is suffering %0.2f arcane damage per turn.  All resistances are reduced by 10%%%s.", "目标被魔法毒素感染，每回合受到 %0.2f 奥术伤害，所有伤害抗性下降 10%% %s。", "tformat")
t(" and poison resistance is reduced by %s%%", "，且毒素抗性下降 %s%%", "tformat")
t("#Target# is magically poisoned!", "#Target#被魔法毒素感染！", "_t")
t("#Target# is no longer magically poisoned.", "#Target#不再受魔法毒素影响。", "_t")
t("The target is attracting all toward it, also dealing fire, light and physical damage each turn..", "目标将所有生物拉向自身，并每回合造成火焰、光系和物理伤害。", "tformat")
t("#Target# starts to attract all creatures around!", "#Target#开始吸引周围的所有生物！", "_t")
t("#Target# is no longer attracting creatures.", "#Target#不再吸引周围的生物。", "_t")
t("The target assumes the form of a telugoroth.", "目标呈现出泰鲁戈洛斯形态。", "tformat")
t("#Target# threads time as a shell!", "#Target#将时间编织成外壳！", "_t")
t("#Target# is no longer embeded in time.", "#Target#不再嵌于时间之中。", "_t")
t("Corrupted Losgoroth Form", "堕落的洛斯格罗斯形态", "_t")
t("The target has assumed the form of a corrupted losgoroth, gaining immunity to poison, disease, bleeding, and confusion.  It does not need to breathe, and converts half of all damage to life draining blight.", "目标呈现出堕落的洛斯格罗斯形态。获得毒素、疾病、流血和混乱免疫。不需要呼吸，将所造成的一半伤害转化为枯萎吸血伤害。", "tformat")
t("#Target# turns into a losgoroth!", "#Target#变成了洛斯格罗斯！", "_t")
t("+Corrupted Losgoroth Form", "+堕落的洛斯格罗斯形态", "_t")
t("-Corrupted Losgoroth Form", "-堕落的洛斯格罗斯形态", "_t")
t("#Target# turns into a shivgoroth!", "#Target#变成了西弗格罗斯！", "_t")
t("Keepers of Reality Rally Call", "现实守护者的集结号令", "_t")
t("The keepers of reality have called upon all to defend Point Zero. Life increased by 5000, damage by 300%.", "现实守护者号召所有人保卫零点圣域。生命值增加 5000 点，伤害增加 300%。", "_t")
t("You can sense the presence of all %s around you.", "你能感知周围所有%s的存在。", "tformat")
t("%s damage increased by 20%%.", "%s 伤害增加 20%%。", "tformat")
t("The target consumed souls to gain new powers. %d spells affected.", "目标消耗灵魂以获得新的力量。%d 个法术受到影响。", "tformat")
t("The target is covered in a layer of ice. Its armour is increased by %d, it deals %0.1f Cold damage to attackers that hit in melee, and 50%% of its damage is converted to cold.", "目标被一层冰覆盖，护甲提高 %d 点；近战命中它的攻击者会受到 %0.1f 点寒冷伤害，它造成的伤害中有 50%% 转化为寒冷伤害。", "tformat")
t("The target is coated with acid. When struck in melee, it has a %d%% chance to spray a cone of acid towards the attacker doing %0.1f damage.", "目标被酸液涂层覆盖。受到近战攻击时，有 %d%% 几率朝攻击者喷出一道锥形酸液，造成 %0.1f 伤害。", "tformat")
t("#Target#'s acid coating is diluted.", "#Target#身上的酸液涂层被稀释了。", "_t")
t("The target is filled with the Sun's fury, next Sun Beam will be instant cast.", "目标充满太阳之怒，下一发阳光烈焰将瞬间施放。", "tformat")
t("The target is protected by the sun, increasing their spell casting speed by %d%%, reducing spell cooldowns by %d%%, and preventing damage over %d%% of your maximum life from a single hit.", "目标受到太阳庇护，施法速度提高 %d%%，法术冷却时间缩短 %d%%，且单次攻击造成的伤害不会超过其最大生命的 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is energized and protected by the Sun!", "#Target#被阳光保护并充能！", "_t")
t("#Target# is marked by light!", "#Target#被光之印记标记！", "_t")
t("Lightblight", "光之枯萎", "_t")
t("The creature is blighted by light reducing saves by %d, critical power by %d%%, and causing all light damage received to splash in radius 2 for %d%% damage once a turn.", "生物受到光之枯萎，全豁免降低 %d，暴击伤害加成降低 %d%%。受到光系伤害时，该伤害的 %d%% 会溅射至周围半径 2 的范围；此效果每回合至多触发一次。", "tformat")
t("+Lightblight", "+光之枯萎", "_t")
t("-Lightblight", "-光之枯萎", "_t")
t("The target glows in the light, reducing its stealth and invisibility power by %d, defense by %d and looses all evasion bonus from being unseen.", "目标在光明中显形，潜行与隐形强度降低 %d，闪避值降低 %d，并失去因不可见而获得的躲闪优势。", "tformat")
t("The is invigorated when dealing damage with Searing Sight.", "目标使用灼热之视造成伤害时会获得活力。", "tformat")
t("The target is invigorated from Searing Sight, increasing movement speed by %d%%.", "目标因灼热之视而获得活力，移动速度提高 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("All healing done to the target will instead turn into %d%% blight damage.", "目标受到的所有治疗会逆转为 %d%% 枯萎伤害。", "tformat")
t("Target is reeling from an lightning shock, halving its stun and pinning resistance.", "目标受到闪电冲击而踉跄，震慑与定身免疫减半。", "tformat")
t("The target is unable to teleport and takes %0.2f temporal and %0.2f physical damage if they try.", "目标不能传送，试图传送时将受到 %0.2f 时空伤害和 %0.2f 物理伤害。", "tformat")
t("Breach", "破防", "_t")
t("The target's defenses have been breached, reducing armor hardiness, stun, pin, blindness, and confusion immunity by 50%%.", "目标的防御被削弱了，护甲强度以及震慑、定身、致盲、混乱免疫降低 50%%。", "tformat")
t("+Breach", "+破防", "_t")
