t("Increases crit chance by %d%% and critical power by %d%%. %d charge(s).", "暴击率提高 %d%%，暴击伤害加成提高 %d%%。充能：%d。", "tformat")
t("Inscriptions cooldown twice as fast.", "刻印冷却速度加倍。", "tformat")
