t("The orb burns to your touch and a loud shout screams out!", "这颗水晶球摸上去滚烫，一声响亮的呼喊冲天而起！", "_t")
t("The orb glows brightly. There is a loud crack coming from the northern central chamber.", "水晶球闪耀着光芒。北部中央大厅传来一声巨响。", "_t")

